cdp
├── when listing targets
│   ├── it keeps only page targets
│   └── it rejects malformed target data
├── when evaluating a script
│   ├── it ignores events and unrelated replies
│   ├── it reports protocol errors
│   └── it reports javascript exceptions
└── when clicking sign in
    ├── it sends trusted events at the button center
    └── it rejects a missing button
